{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53642","headline":"拨櫂歌 三 · 德诚","name":"拨櫂歌 三","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"三（《嘉禾志》作「二」）十余年（《五灯会元》作「年来」、《四溟诗话》作「年前」）坐钓台，竿（《五灯会元》、《嘉禾志》、《四溟诗话》皆作「钩」）头往往得黄龙。\n锦（《五灯会元》、《四溟诗话》作「金」）麟不遇空（《嘉禾志》作「虚」）劳力，收取（《四溟诗话》作「拾」）丝纶归去来。\n（以上三首，《嘉禾志》题作《自题三绝》）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"德诚","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_53642.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53642","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}